{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>They made garments of service, etc.</b> Each garment of a different kind — how so? For the holy Ark and for the Table of the Presence and for the Menorah and for the golden altar and for all the service vessels in the Sanctuary: for each of them, a garment of tekhelet; for the altar of burnt offering, a garment of argaman; for the bread of the Presence and the Table's vessels, a garment of tola'at shani — as is spelled out in the portion of Numbers."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:10.943061667Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}